== Secret Quests ==

* Interact with [[Sky Quest Giver 2]] to start the old temple quest, they will tell the player to enter the temple. To enter the temple, head slightly left or right to the large staircase where there will be a destructible wall blocking off the entrance. In the center of the room there will be towers the player can interact with. Tap the towers so the electric currents are all feeding into the next one, like a circle. When they are all connected, a cutscene will play, where the Relic moves around the room and then into the player's inventory. After that, run back to the quest giver while dodging the Lightning God's attacks.
* When [[Sky Warlord]] awakens, a message will appear in chat saying: '''[[System Messages|''"A storm brews in the upper skylands..."'']]'''  Attack the dark lightning clouds above the structure the Sky Warlord spawns in, this will start the boss sequence.  After they are defeated, a message will appear in chat saying:  '''[[System Messages|''"(Roblox username) toppled the awakened Wysper!"'']]'''
* When [[Lightning God]] awakens, a message will appear in chat saying:  '''[[System Messages|''"The bell shimmers in upper skylands..."'']]'''  The player must go to the bell and strike it. On the bell, there will be pop-ups of a gun, sword, or melee icon. The player must strike the bell with the respective weapon show in the pop-up 6 times in a row, this will play a cutscene starting the boss sequence.  After they are defeated, a message will appear in chat saying:  '''[[System Messages|''"(Roblox username) struck down the awakened Lighting God"'']] 

==Accessing==
[[File:Upper Skylands Entrance.png|thumb|The small entrance, marked with an arrow sign.]]
Accessing the Upper Skylands requires going to the Upper Skylands Entrance, which is a sky island at the top of the regular [[Skylands]] and can be accessed by using [[Air Jump]] while in the regular [[Skylands]].
* After locating the entrance, the player go through the small hole in one of the corners marked with an arrow, or break the cloud covering it with a [[Destructible Physics]] attack. Then, they can jump in.
This information is only true before update 30

==Trivia==
* It is possible to access the Upper Skylands without going through the main entrance, by flying up with a fruit such as [[Light]], or by teleporting up with [[Portal]].
* Before [[Updates/23|Update 23]], The Second [[Quests|Quest]] Giver on the Upper Skylands was called "Gan Fall Adventurer" but now replaced by "Sky Quest Giver 2" due to the copyright.
* The Upper Skylands requires the most grinding out of all islands in [[First Sea]].
* [[Sky Warlord]] used to be called [[Wysper]] but changed names after [[Updates/30|Update 30]]

